{"type":"text","timestamp":1794582972678,"sessionID":"ses_e2a8827bdffecGN51mfmPQmfDl","part":{"id":"prt_1d57af5b0002GP4y5TsfuVH5Cc","sessionID":"ses_e2a8827bdffecGN51mfmPQmfDl","messageID":"msg_1d57ae0bc001IPwgoQh4moQCLe","type":"text","text":"T011 done.\n\n**Files written**\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/doctor-helper-handoff.ts` — added `|show(?:s|ing)? up|appear(?:s|ing)?` to the first `STRONG_PROBLEM_CUE` alternative right after `converg\\w*`, and one sentence to the cue-list comment: a tool or command that does not show up or appear is a wrong state, like one that is not registered or not found.\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/doctor-helper-handoff.vitest.ts` — new case `reads a tool that does not show up as a strong cue` (`the deploy button is not showing up after the update`, `my new agent isn't appearing in the picker` → `strong`; `don't show line numbers in the diff`, `show me how the advisor ranks skills` → `null`).\n- `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/scorer/doctor-handoff-command.vitest.ts` — new case `offers the helper beside the skills for a tool that does not show up`: reads `cmd-doctor-mcp-plain-tune-01` from `command-prompts.jsonl` by id, asserts `split === 'tune'` before reading the prompt, then asserts `ids[0] === 'mcp-code-mode'` and `command-doctor-helper` in `ids.slice(0, 3)`.\n\n**Verify output**\n\n`npm run typecheck` (in `ADV`):\n```\n> typecheck\n> ../../system-spec-kit/node_modules/.bin/tsc --noEmit --composite false -p tsconfig.build.json\n```\nExit 0.\n\n`env -u AI_SESSION_CHILD npx vitest run tests/doctor-helper-handoff.vitest.ts tests/scorer/doctor-handoff-command.vitest.ts tests/doctor-routing-slice.vitest.ts`:\n```\n Test Files  3 passed (3)\n      Tests  25 passed (25)\n   Duration  2.17s\n```\nVerbose confirmation that the new cases ran:\n```\n ✓ tests/scorer/doctor-handoff-command.vitest.ts > doctor hand-off command > offers the helper beside the skills for a tool that does not show up\n ✓ tests/doctor-helper-handoff.vitest.ts > doctor problem cue > reads a tool that does not show up as a strong cue\n```\n\n**Not done**\n- Checkbox not ticked, git untouched.\n- `git status` shows other modified files (`scoring-compatibility.json`, `measure-brief-cost.mjs`, `command-prompts.jsonl`, etc.) from concurrent workers; my diff is limited to the three files above.\n- The `sk-code` compiled router returned `defer` for this prompt. I did not ask, since this is a non-interactive leaf bound to an exact task line, and the change is the literal edit that line specifies.","time":{"start":1794582967728,"end":1794582972678}}}
